title: "Grokking under federated learning: two clocks, partition structure, and a memorising fixed point"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-08
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/helpmatteo/federated_learning_grokking"
url: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/FedGrok/fedgrok-checkpoints"
authors:
